= Parlament de Catalunya

{!<div id="parlament" data-widget="hemicycle" data-props='{"configFrom":"parlament_hemicycle"}'></div>!}
{!<div style='margin-top: -2em; width: 100%; font-style: italic; text-align: center'>!} Majority: [+ parlament_s_majority +]{!</div>!}
{!<div style='margin-top: -1em; width: 100%; text-align: center'>!} Speaker of the House:<br/>[+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +]){!</div>!}

